  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-82724\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p></p><p>First, let's write the sentence more concisely:</p><p></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The apple is green or red.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Using the commutative law, we can swap the order of the words \"green\" and \"red.\" The sentence now reads</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The apple is red or green.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>",
